2. Appointment Assistance (retrieve authorized appointment schedule and status)
3. Ward Availability (check bed capacity across hospital wards)
4. General Hospital Information &amp; Procedures

Important Notice: I do not provide clinical diagnosis, medical treatment advice, or emergency services. For acute medical emergencies, please contact emergency services or report to the emergency department immediately.</message>
                <messageIdentifier>cn-welcome-msg-001</messageIdentifier>
            </botMessages>
            <stepIdentifier>cn-welcome-step-001</stepIdentifier>
            <type>Message</type>
